#: streamlit_app.py:39
msgid "# 30 Days of Streamlit"
msgstr "# 30일간의 Streamlit"

#: streamlit_app.py:52
msgid "Start the Challenge 👇"
msgstr "챌린지 시작하기 👇"

#: streamlit_app.py:56
msgid "About the #30DaysOfStreamlit"
msgstr "#30DaysOfStreamlit 소개"

#: streamlit_app.py:57
msgid "\n    The **#30DaysOfStreamlit** is a coding challenge designed to help you get started in building Streamlit apps.\n    \n    Particularly, you'll be able to:\n    - Set up a coding environment for building Streamlit apps\n    - Build your first Streamlit app\n    - Learn about all the awesome input/output widgets to use for your Streamlit app\n    "
msgstr "\n    **#30DaysOfStreamlit**은 Streamlit 앱 만들기를 시작할 수 있도록 돕는 코딩 챌린지입니다.\n    \n    이 챌린지에서는 다음을 배울 수 있습니다.\n    - Streamlit 앱을 만들기 위한 코딩 환경 설정하기\n    - 첫 번째 Streamlit 앱 만들기\n    - Streamlit 앱에서 사용할 수 있는 다양한 입력 및 출력 위젯 알아보기\n    "

#: streamlit_app.py:69
msgid "About"
msgstr "소개"

#: streamlit_app.py:70
msgid "[Streamlit](https://streamlit.io) is a Python library that allows the creation of interactive, data-driven web applications in Python."
msgstr "[Streamlit](https://streamlit.io)은 Python으로 데이터 기반의 대화형 웹 애플리케이션을 만들 수 있는 Python 라이브러리입니다."

#: streamlit_app.py:74
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "학습 자료"

#: streamlit_app.py:75
msgid "\n- [Streamlit Documentation](https://docs.streamlit.io/)\n- [Cheat sheet](https://docs.streamlit.io/library/cheatsheet)\n- [Book](https://www.amazon.com/dp/180056550X) (Getting Started with Streamlit for Data Science)\n- [Blog](https://blog.streamlit.io/how-to-master-streamlit-for-data-science/) (How to master Streamlit for data science)\n"
msgstr "\n- [Streamlit 문서](https://docs.streamlit.io/)\n- [빠른 참조표](https://docs.streamlit.io/library/cheatsheet)\n- [도서](https://www.amazon.com/dp/180056550X) (Getting Started with Streamlit for Data Science)\n- [블로그](https://blog.streamlit.io/how-to-master-streamlit-for-data-science/) (데이터 과학을 위한 Streamlit 활용법)\n"

#: streamlit_app.py:84
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "배포"

#: streamlit_app.py:85
msgid "You can quickly deploy Streamlit apps using [Streamlit Community Cloud](https://streamlit.io/cloud) in just a few clicks."
msgstr "[Streamlit Community Cloud](https://streamlit.io/cloud)를 사용하면 몇 번의 클릭만으로 Streamlit 앱을 빠르게 배포할 수 있습니다."

